  "La Patagonia, compartida entre Argentina y Chile, combina glaciares, montañas y estepas en un paisaje de extremos. Caminar cerca del glaciar Perito Moreno permite escuchar el estruendo del hielo al desprenderse. Las distancias son enormes y el clima cambia sin previo aviso. Quienes la visitan suelen describirla como un lugar que hace sentir pequeño frente a la naturaleza.": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Patagonia, shared between Argentina and Chile, combines glaciers, mountains and steppes in a landscape of extremes. Walking near the Perito Moreno glacier lets you hear the roar of the ice as it breaks off. Distances are huge and the weather changes without warning. Those who visit it often describe it as a place that makes you feel small in front of nature.",
